OL,3,ABBC secret filming shows dog breeder
OL,4,Aselling sick puppies for #2k each
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Katie Thornton paid #2,000 for a
OL,7,Fnine-week-old puppy for her son, she
OL,8,Fknew it was a premium price - but was
OL,9,Fhappy to be doing business with a
OL,10,F"legit", council-approved breeder.
OL,12,FBut Ozzy the Dobermann pup started
OL,13,Fcoughing in the car on the way home,
OL,14,Fand within 48 hours he was in a
OL,15,Fveterinary hospital receiving urgent
OL,16,Ftreatment for pneumonia.
OL,18,FSince then, his ongoing health problems
OL,19,Fmean Katie has racked up more than
OL,20,F#5,000 in vet bills.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
