OL,3,AIndia's 'cockroach' party leader says
OL,4,Ahe was stopped from flying to UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leader of India's "cockroach" party
OL,7,Fhas said that immigration officials at
OL,8,FDelhi airport stopped him from flying
OL,9,Fto the UK, where he was set to attend a
OL,10,Fseries of events.
OL,12,FSaurav Das said he was supposed to
OL,13,Fboard a flight on Tuesday at 01:00
OL,14,Flocal time (19:30 GMT on Monday) but
OL,15,Fwas told by immigration officers that
OL,16,Fhis passport had been "flagged".
OL,18,FIt is not clear yet why Das's passport
OL,19,Fwas flagged. The BBC has reached out to
OL,20,Fthe federal home ministry, Delhi police
OL,21,Fand airport officials for comment.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
